{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_97_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"繼正即位，正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"二、二月，癸亥，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"三、天王使叔服來會葬。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"葬曰會，其志重天子之禮也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"四、夏，四月，丁巳，葬我君僖公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"薨稱公，舉上也。葬我君，接上下也。僖公葬而後舉謚，謚所以成德也，於卒事乎加之矣。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"五、天王使毛伯來錫公命。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"禮有受命，無來錫命。錫命非正也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"六、晉侯伐衞。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"七、叔孫得臣如京師。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"八、衞人伐晉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"九、秋，公孫敖會晉侯於戚。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"十、冬，十月，丁未，楚世子商臣弒其君髠。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"日髠之卒，所以謹商臣之弒也。夷狄不言正不正。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_97_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_97","textTraditional":"十一、公孫敖如齊。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}